==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=pinna}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪnə|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|Pinner}} {{qualifier|in non-rhotic accents}}

[[File:Gray904.png|thumb|Diagram of the '''pinna''' (part of ear)]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|pinnae}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The visible part of the [[ear]] that resides outside of the [[head]], the [[auricle]]; [[outer ear]] excluding the [[ear canal]].
# {{lb|en|botany}} A [[leaflet]] or primary segment of a [[pinnate]] compound leaf.
# {{lb|en|zoology}} A [[feather]], [[wing]], [[fin]], or other similar [[appendage]].

