==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sv|fi}} {{m|sv|pinne}} ("stick, spoke").

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[spoke]] (of a wheel, ie. in bicycle)
# {{lb|fi|nautical}} [[tiller]]
# {{lb|fi|colloquial}} [[point]] (unit of scoring in a game or competition)
# {{lb|fi|colloquial}} [[temper]], [[nerve]], [[fuse]] (in the sense of loosing one's temper)
#: ''Marian '''pinna''' paloi.''
#:: Maria lost her '''temper'''.
#: ''Marialla on lyhyt '''pinna'''.''
#:: Maria's got a short '''fuse'''.
# {{lb|fi|colloquial}} [[percent]]

